[statement]
A removal waits for every package that needed it: `ol` goes after both
`app1` and `app2` are upgraded, before `mid` is installed.

[repository]
P:app1
V:2

P:app2
V:2

P:mid
V:1

[installed]
P:ol
V:1

P:app1
V:1
D:ol

P:app2
V:1
D:ol

[world]
app1
app2

[request]
app1>=2
app2>=2
mid

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
upgrade app1 1 2
upgrade app2 1 2
remove ol 1
install mid 1
